  "同族优先：自动档只选源族，手动目标保留明确选择；严格同族：手动跨族也拒绝；兼容重采样：允许自动跨族回退。": "Prefer same family: automatic modes stay in the source family and explicit manual targets are preserved. Strict same family: manual cross-family targets are rejected too. Compatible resampling: automatic cross-family fallback is allowed.",
